<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Game systems" data-copy-zh="游戏系统">Game systems</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Crystals and Doomsday" data-copy-zh="水晶与末日倒计时">Crystals and Doomsday</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Plan Crystal spending, extend the timeline, compare both shops, and find reliable one-time and repeatable rewards." data-copy-zh="安排水晶开销，延长时间线，比较两处商店，并分清一次性奖励与可重复的获取方式。">Plan Crystal spending, extend the timeline, compare both shops, and find reliable one-time and repeatable rewards.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Crystals buy time and permanent growth</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-timer">How the Doomsday countdown works</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-shops">Where to spend Crystals</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-catalog">Crystal-shop reference</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-sources">Earn Crystals: repeatable sources and milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-coins">The Dragon Coin route: what remains reliable</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-planning">Plan spending around the next decision</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-codes">Crystal-code entry and related references</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">水晶：延长期限与永久成长</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-timer">末日倒计时如何推进</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-shops">水晶商店在哪里</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-catalog">水晶商店项目表</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-sources">获得水晶：可重复来源与里程碑</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-coins">龙币路线：哪些规则仍然可靠</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-planning">按下一步目标安排支出</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-codes">水晶码入口与相关参考</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview">
<h2>Crystals buy time and permanent growth</h2>
<p><strong>Crystals are a separate currency from Gems and Dragon Coins.</strong> They pay for timeline extensions, selected skills and permanent upgrades. Check the Crystal balance in your inventory before spending: a Crystal used on an optional purchase is also one you cannot use to buy ten more days or reserve for New Game+.</p><p>Several Crystal-shop purchases are repeatable. A named purchase appearing in the shop does not mean it is a once-per-save reward. Conversely, a milestone that awards a Crystal usually has its own one-time claim record. The two rules should not be confused.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-timer">
<h2>How the Doomsday countdown works</h2>
<p>A fresh timeline begins on <strong>day 1 at 08:00</strong> with <strong>60 days</strong> on the Doomsday countdown. This is an <strong>in-game deadline</strong>: leaving an action menu open does not consume days in real time. Travel, training, work and other time-costing actions advance the clock. Watch the displayed countdown after an overnight activity rather than estimating solely from your real-world session length.</p><p>Health, Energy and Calm can also affect how much time an action costs. At less than 20% of a resource’s maximum, that resource multiplies the time cost by 1.5; an empty resource uses a ×2 multiplier instead. Multiple low resources compound. Recovering before a long action can protect both your resources and your remaining days.</p><p>Before the world is saved, letting the countdown reach zero can end the run. Use <strong>Extend Timeline</strong> while you still have time and shop access: <strong>1 Crystal adds 10 days</strong>. There is no normal once-only purchase limit. After the HUD changes to <strong>World Saved</strong>, the deadline is disabled and the extension action is unavailable. Starting New Game+ creates a new 60-day countdown.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-shops">
<h2>Where to spend Crystals</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Guide</th><th scope="col">Route</th><th scope="col">Hours</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="Route">Medieval → Kings Demesne → Back Alleys → Secret Lair → Lillian’s Lair</td><td data-label="Hours">24 hours</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="Route">Future → Fringe Zone → Weather Control → Cloudy Path → Seraph’s Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Hours">24 hours</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Use the location’s normal action list. The Secret Lair and Cloudy Path entry actions themselves take no time; reaching the district and approach still follows ordinary travel rules. Individual purchases can have their own requirements. Having Crystals does not remove a venue or content-access requirement.</p>
<p>Weather Control is the map button; entering it opens Sky-Level Atmospheric Management Station, where the onward routes are listed.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 540px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Lillian’s normal action list includes timeline extensions and permanent growth. The Crystal balance shown is an example." href="../assets/images/wiki/crystals-and-doomsday-guide/en-crystal-shop.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lillian’s normal action list includes timeline extensions and permanent growth. The Crystal balance shown is an example." decoding="async" height="379" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/crystals-and-doomsday-guide/en-crystal-shop.webp" width="397"/></a><figcaption>Lillian’s normal action list includes timeline extensions and permanent growth. The Crystal balance shown is an example.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-catalog">
<h2>Crystal-shop reference</h2>
<p>The purchases below take <strong>0 minutes</strong> themselves. Prices are in Crystals. The maximum-resource boosts are permanent growth, not healing items.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Seller</th><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Price</th><th scope="col">Effect and limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Both guides</th><td data-label="Action">Extend Timeline</td><td data-label="Price">1</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">+10 days to the active Doomsday countdown. Repeatable before World Saved; unavailable afterward.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Both guides</th><td data-label="Action">Crystal Enlightenment</td><td data-label="Price">1</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Learn one randomly selected unknown, non-exclusive skill. Repeatable while an eligible unknown skill remains; the result cannot be chosen.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="Action">Learn Light Magic</td><td data-label="Price">3</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Learn Light Magic once; the action is hidden once learned.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="Action">Instant 1000 Wealth</td><td data-label="Price">1</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Gain $1,000. Repeatable. Consider whether an ordinary income source would save a Crystal.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="Action">Divine Vitality Boost</td><td data-label="Price">1</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Permanently increase maximum Health by 10. Repeatable; increasing the maximum does not refill current Health.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="Action">Learn Dark Magic</td><td data-label="Price">3</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Learn Dark Magic once; the action is hidden once learned.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="Action">Resource Boost</td><td data-label="Price">1</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Gain 50 Common, 20 Rare and 3 Epic of EACH resource category: materials, fabrics and ingredients. Repeatable.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="Action">Infernal Vitality Boost</td><td data-label="Price">1</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Permanently increase maximum Energy by 10. Repeatable; increasing the maximum does not refill current Energy.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Both guides, when eligible</th><td data-label="Action">Proficiency Upgrade</td><td data-label="Price">10</td><td data-label="Effect and limit">Purchase the advanced proficiency upgrade. Its content-access requirement still applies. It must be bought again after New Game+.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Proficiency Upgrade is listed separately from a starting-profession choice. It requires Patreon Adventurer Tier+ access. Buying it changes your proficiency to Patreon Master, upgrades your bedroom and opens advanced training and work options. New Game+ explicitly resets the purchased upgrade while preserving earned character stats and retained equipment levels.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-sources">
<h2>Earn Crystals: repeatable sources and milestones</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">What to expect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Gonzo’s dungeon shop</th><td data-label="What to expect">Trade 25 Dragon Coins for 1 Crystal, or 23 with Negotiation. Repeatable while you have coins and meet the wandering merchant.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mining</th><td data-label="What to expect">Crystal fragments accumulate; each 100 fragments automatically becomes 1 whole Crystal. Pickaxe and mining rules still apply.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dungeon encounters</th><td data-label="What to expect">Some successful encounter results award whole Crystals. These are chance-based; encountering a crystal-themed room does not guarantee currency.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tutorial quests</th><td data-label="What to expect">Four individual quests pay 1 Crystal each. Claim all fifteen tutorial rewards for a further 3 Crystals: 7 in total from the tutorial panel.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship mastery</th><td data-label="What to expect">Each eligible relationship reaching 3,000 points or In Love can award 1 Crystal. Return to your current profession bedroom to collect the recognition. Once per eligible person, including across New Game+.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caterpillar populations</th><td data-label="What to expect">Combined population milestones of 500,000 / 5,000,000 / 100,000,000 award 1 / 3 / 5 Crystals. Visit the Present forest or Medieval Whispering Woods to trigger their recognition.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Combat milestones</th><td data-label="What to expect">500 Cuckers: return to the Medieval Rural Farm for 1 Crystal. 50 Ratmen: visit Lillian’s Lair for 1 Crystal. These count the specified enemy type, not every enemy or every rat.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Other activities</th><td data-label="What to expect">Guild progression, Kupie achievements, the original Haunted Mansion and particular one-time challenges have their own rewards. Follow their dedicated guides and collect the actual award; a trophy entry alone does not pay Crystals.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Relationship, population and enemy-milestone rewards are one-time awards. A new timeline does not turn the same already paid milestone into a repeatable Crystal source. Use the genuinely repeatable coin trade or mining if you need an ongoing supply.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-coins">
<h2>The Dragon Coin route: what remains reliable</h2>
<p>Gonzo’s offer is a direct trade in his shop: <strong>25 Dragon Coins → 1 Crystal</strong>, discounted to <strong>23</strong> by <strong>Negotiation</strong>. The shop loops after a purchase, so you may buy another if you have enough coins. Gonzo is a wandering encounter; neither his location nor an immediate encounter is guaranteed.</p><p>The community floor-13 route still has a concrete basis: each generated water floor attempts to place one underwater Dragon Coin. After you have unlocked floor 13 in the floor picker, collect its coin, leave, then enter a newly generated floor 13 to look for the next. Entering through Explore Ancient Catacombs and using the dungeon exit take no time themselves. Actual movement normally costs 4 minutes per step, reduced by 1 each for Fleet Footed and an active Time buff, before resource-related time penalties. Plan short paths and recover when necessary. The coin route is repeatable, but the old fixed “one day for ten days” estimate is not a guaranteed timetable. Seek Gonzo on an eligible ordinary floor; the normal generation roll to add him is 10%, with a suitable placement also needed.</p><p>Kupie’s shop offers a Dragon Coin for <strong>$1,000,000</strong>, with <strong>one purchase per in-game day</strong> and shop stock also required. Rebirth does not erase that day’s Dragon Coin purchase limit. It is an expensive backup source, not a cheap Crystal conversion. The home action named Recycle Crystals is a separate conditional one-time repair, not Gonzo’s coin exchange.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-planning">
<h2>Plan spending around the next decision</h2>
<ol><li>If the deadline is becoming tight, reserve a Crystal for Extend Timeline before buying optional growth. Buying it at either guide extends the same countdown.</li><li>Save 5 Crystals if you intend to start New Game+. Allow another 10 if you want to repurchase Proficiency Upgrade in the new timeline and meet its access requirement.</li><li>For a known missing magic skill, compare the direct 3-Crystal purchase with random Enlightenment. Enlightenment cannot promise a particular result.</li><li>Compare Resource Boost with your actual building, tailoring and crafting needs. One purchase gives all three categories, including their Epic resources.</li><li>Keep ordinary income and healing options in mind before converting a scarce Crystal into $1,000 or buying a maximum-resource increase when you only need recovery.</li></ol><p>Crystals also fund specific services outside these two shops, including <a href="game-systems-sylwithes-hollow.html">Sylwithe’s upgrades</a> and selected advanced activities. Check the individual action’s cost; this shop table is not a promise that every Crystal service costs 1.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-codes">
<h2>Crystal-code entry and related references</h2>
<p>Lillian’s <strong>Redeem Crystal Code</strong> action opens the code-entry screen and takes no time. Use a code published for your version through an official channel, exactly as supplied. The game tracks redeemed codes, including through New Game+, so restarting a timeline does not make a previously redeemed code reusable. This guide does not list unverified or private codes.</p><p>Related guides: <a href="character-lillian.html">Lillian</a>, <a href="character-seraph.html">Seraph</a>, <a href="items.html">Items</a>, <a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">Caterpillars</a>, <a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">Fighters Guild</a> and <a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Love Training</a>.</p>
<p>Related progression guides: <a href="game-systems-new-game-plus.html">New Game+ and Postgame</a> · <a href="game-systems-objectives-and-achievements.html">Objectives, Tutorials and Trophy Goals</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview">
<h2>水晶：延长期限与永久成长</h2>
<p><strong>水晶、宝石与龙币是三种不同货币。</strong>水晶可用来延长时间线、学习特定技能，以及购买永久强化。花费前先查看库存余额：用于可选强化的水晶，也就不能再用来换取十天时间，或留作新游戏+的费用。</p><p>水晶商店中有多项可重复购买的服务。动作有固定名称，不代表它只能买一次；反过来，奖励水晶的里程碑通常各自有一次性领取记录。购买规则和奖励规则需要分开看。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-timer">
<h2>末日倒计时如何推进</h2>
<p>新时间线从<strong>第1天08:00</strong>开始，末日倒计时为<strong>60天</strong>。这是<strong>游戏内期限</strong>：停留在动作菜单上，不会按现实时间消耗天数。旅行、训练、工作等有耗时的动作才会推进时钟。跨夜活动结束后，应查看实际倒计时，不要用现实游玩了多久来估算。</p><p>生命、精力与镇定也会影响动作耗时。某项低于其上限的20%时，会让耗时乘1.5；该项耗尽时，则改为乘2。多项同时偏低会叠乘。开始长时间活动前先恢复状态，能同时节省资源与剩余天数。</p><p>世界获救前，倒计时归零可能使本次游玩结束。请在仍有时间、还能访问商店时使用<strong>延长时间线</strong>：<strong>1颗水晶增加10天</strong>，正常情况下可以重复购买。当时间栏变为<strong>世界已获救</strong>时，期限停用，该动作也不再提供。开启新游戏+后，会重新获得60天倒计时。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-shops">
<h2>水晶商店在哪里</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">人物</th><th scope="col">路线</th><th scope="col">在场时间</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="路线">中世纪 → 国王领地 → 后巷 → 秘密巢穴 → Lillian的巢穴</td><td data-label="在场时间">全天</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="路线">未来 → 边缘区 → 天气控制 → 云雾小径 → Seraph的圣所</td><td data-label="在场时间">全天</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>抵达后，从地点的常规动作列表选择服务。「秘密巢穴」与「云雾小径」这两个入口动作本身不耗时；前往所在区域与沿途地点，仍按正常旅行规则计算。个别购买项目还有自身条件，持有水晶不会解除地点或内容的访问限制。</p>
<p>地图上的「天气控制」打开的是地点标题为「天空级大气管理站」的场所；后续路线从那里选择。</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 540px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Lillian的常规动作列表提供延长时间线与永久强化。图中的水晶余额仅为示例。" href="../assets/images/wiki/crystals-and-doomsday-guide/zh-crystal-shop.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lillian的常规动作列表提供延长时间线与永久强化。图中的水晶余额仅为示例。" decoding="async" height="379" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/crystals-and-doomsday-guide/zh-crystal-shop.webp" width="397"/></a><figcaption>Lillian的常规动作列表提供延长时间线与永久强化。图中的水晶余额仅为示例。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-catalog">
<h2>水晶商店项目表</h2>
<p>下表动作本身均耗时<strong>0分钟</strong>，价格单位为水晶。资源上限强化属于永久成长，不能当作即时恢复道具。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">提供者</th><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">价格</th><th scope="col">效果与限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">两处均有</th><td data-label="动作">延长时间线</td><td data-label="价格">1</td><td data-label="效果与限制">为仍在运行的末日倒计时增加10天。获救前可重复购买，世界已获救后不再提供。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">两处均有</th><td data-label="动作">水晶启迪</td><td data-label="价格">1</td><td data-label="效果与限制">随机学会一项尚未掌握的非专属技能；仍有符合条件的未知技能时可继续购买，不能指定结果。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="动作">学习光明魔法</td><td data-label="价格">3</td><td data-label="效果与限制">学会光明魔法；掌握后该动作隐藏。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="动作">立即获得1000财富</td><td data-label="价格">1</td><td data-label="效果与限制">获得1,000财富，可重复购买。使用前可先比较普通赚钱方式，避免不必要地消耗水晶。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph</th><td data-label="动作">神圣活力增强</td><td data-label="价格">1</td><td data-label="效果与限制">生命上限永久增加10，可重复购买；提高上限不会同时补满当前生命。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="动作">学习黑暗魔法</td><td data-label="价格">3</td><td data-label="效果与限制">学会黑暗魔法；掌握后该动作隐藏。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="动作">资源增幅</td><td data-label="价格">1</td><td data-label="效果与限制">材料、布料、原料各获得普通50、稀有20、史诗3；三个类别全部发放，可重复购买。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian</th><td data-label="动作">地狱活力增强</td><td data-label="价格">1</td><td data-label="效果与限制">精力上限永久增加10，可重复购买；提高上限不会同时补满当前精力。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">满足条件时，两处均可</th><td data-label="动作">熟练度升级</td><td data-label="价格">10</td><td data-label="效果与限制">购买进阶熟练度升级，仍需满足其内容访问条件。开启新游戏+后需要重新购买。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>「熟练度升级」与选择初始职业不同。这项升级需要Patreon Adventurer Tier+访问资格。购买后，熟练度会变为Patreon 大师，卧室得到强化，并开放进阶训练与工作选项。新游戏+会明确重置这项已购升级，但保留已获得的角色属性与可保留装备的等级。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-sources">
<h2>获得水晶：可重复来源与里程碑</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">来源</th><th scope="col">奖励与注意事项</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Gonzo的地下城商店</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">25枚龙币换1颗水晶；掌握谈判后为23枚。只要有足够龙币并遇到这位游商，就可重复兑换。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">采矿</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">水晶碎片会累计，每100片自动合成1颗完整水晶；仍需遵守镐具与采矿本身的规则。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地下城遭遇</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">部分遭遇的成功结果会给完整水晶，但带有水晶主题的房间并不保证产出货币。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">教程任务</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">四项单独任务各给1颗水晶；十五项奖励全部领取后，再得3颗，教程面板合计可得7颗。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系培养</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">符合条件的关系达到3,000点或恋爱中后，可获得1颗水晶。返回当前职业对应的卧室领取认可奖励；每人限一次，跨新游戏+也不会重复发放。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">毛毛虫种群</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">两时代合计种群达到500,000／5,000,000／100,000,000，分别奖励1／3／5颗水晶。前往现代森林或中世纪低语森林触发相应认可。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战斗里程碑</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">击败500只Cucker后返回中世纪乡间农场，可得1颗；击败50只鼠人后前往Lillian的巢穴，可得1颗。计数针对指定敌人，不是所有敌人或所有鼠类。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">其他活动</th><td data-label="奖励与注意事项">公会进度、Kupie成就、原版闹鬼宅邸及部分一次性挑战各有奖励。请按相应指南实际领取；奖杯条目本身不会额外发水晶。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>关系、种群与指定敌人的里程碑都属于一次性奖励。开启新时间线，不会把已经领过的同一里程碑变成水晶日常。需要长期来源时，可考虑真正能重复的龙币兑换或采矿。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-coins">
<h2>龙币路线：哪些规则仍然可靠</h2>
<p>Gonzo商店的兑换规则明确：<strong>25枚龙币换1颗水晶</strong>，掌握<strong>谈判</strong>后降为<strong>23枚</strong>。购买后会返回商店菜单，龙币足够就能继续买。Gonzo属于游商遭遇，出现地点与能否立刻遇到都不保证。</p><p>社区攻略的第13层路线仍有依据：每次生成的水下楼层会尝试放置一枚水下龙币。在楼层选择器中解锁第13层后，可以进去取币、离开，再进入重新生成的第13层寻找下一枚。「探索古代地下墓穴」入口动作与地下城退出操作本身不耗时；实际移动通常每步4分钟，步履轻盈技能和生效中的时间增益各减1分钟，之后仍受资源过低的耗时惩罚影响。尽量规划短路线，并及时恢复状态。这条取币路线可以重复，但旧攻略固定「花一天换十天」的估算不是保证。Gonzo则应在允许游商的普通楼层寻找，常规生成时有10%的添加判定，还需找到合适位置。</p><p>Kupie商店每枚龙币售价<strong>1,000,000财富</strong>，并且<strong>每个游戏日只能购买一枚</strong>，还需要有库存。重生不会清除当天的龙币购买限制。这是一条昂贵的备用来源，不能视作便宜的水晶兑换。家中的「回收水晶」是另一个有条件的一次性修复动作，与Gonzo的龙币兑换无关。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-planning">
<h2>按下一步目标安排支出</h2>
<ol><li>期限吃紧时，先为「延长时间线」留一颗水晶，再考虑可选强化。两处商店延长的是同一个倒计时。</li><li>打算开启新游戏+时，先留5颗。如果新周目还要重新购买熟练度升级，则另留10颗，并确认届时能满足访问条件。</li><li>明确缺少某项魔法时，可比较3颗水晶直接学习与随机启迪。启迪不能保证抽到指定技能。</li><li>按实际建设、服装和制作需求衡量资源增幅。一次购买会发放全部三个资源类别，包括史诗资源。</li><li>如果只是需要即时恢复，先考虑普通回复方式；如果只是缺钱，也可先考虑普通收入，避免把稀缺水晶换成1,000财富。</li></ol><p>两处商店之外，<a href="game-systems-sylwithes-hollow.html">Sylwithe的强化</a>等特定服务也会消耗水晶。请查看各动作自己的价格；本表不表示所有水晶服务都只收1颗。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-codes">
<h2>水晶码入口与相关参考</h2>
<p>Lillian的<strong>兑换水晶码</strong>动作会打开输入画面，本身不耗时。请使用官方渠道为当前版本公布的兑换码，并按原样输入。已兑换记录会保留至新游戏+，重开时间线不能让用过的码重新生效。本页不列未经核实或非公开的兑换码。</p><p>相关指南：<a href="character-lillian.html">Lillian</a>、<a href="character-seraph.html">Seraph</a>、<a href="items.html">物品</a>、<a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">毛毛虫</a>、<a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">战士公会</a>与<a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie 的爱之训练</a>。</p>
<p>相关成长指南：<a href="game-systems-new-game-plus.html">新游戏+与通关后玩法</a> · <a href="game-systems-objectives-and-achievements.html">任务、教程与奖杯目标</a></p></section>
